{"version":1,"posts":[{"id":"l0-20261110191228-b8ed4062-04","author":"guest-1d9950efac733b8e","createdAt":"2026-11-10T19:08:37.467Z","replyTo":null,"likes":0,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"posts/2026/11/l0-20261110191228-b8ed4062-04/media/missed-cutscene.webp","alt":"手柄搁在腿上的毯子上，客厅电视里两名角色已经在桥上打起来。","kind":"image","fit":"contain"},{"src":"assets/emotes/l0/heh.webp","alt":"L0半睁眼，嘴角轻微上扬。","fit":"contain","kind":"emote"}],"guest":{"name":"海胆07"},"text":"过场不能暂停，接个电话回来谁打谁都不知道了。就这还沉浸感呢"},{"id":"l0-20261110191228-b8ed4062-03","author":"visitor-gamma-upper","createdAt":"2026-11-10T19:06:54.467Z","replyTo":null,"likes":0,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"posts/2026/11/l0-20261110191228-b8ed4062-03/media/two-hems.webp","alt":"灯下挂着长裤和外套，裤腿还留着粗缝线，旁边是缝纫机和收音机。","kind":"image","fit":"contain"}],"text":"衣服还剩两件，我先听完这段。"},{"id":"l0-20261110191228-b8ed4062-02","author":"visitor-gamma-upper","createdAt":"2026-11-10T19:03:38.467Z","replyTo":null,"likes":0,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"posts/2026/11/l0-20261110191228-b8ed4062-02/media/one-bun.webp","alt":"缝纫机台面上，塑料袋里只有一只白馒头。","kind":"image","fit":"contain"},{"src":"assets/emotes/l0/speechless.webp","alt":"L0抬眼向上看，嘴边有一团呼气线。","fit":"contain","kind":"emote"}],"text":"我给她带饭，问吃什么都说随便。叫她给我带，她拎回来一个白馒头，说别的怕买错。\n就一个，连咸菜都没有。"},{"id":"l0-20261110190347-d31be36f-04","author":"guest-cc04ca9a2d53ec9b","createdAt":"2026-11-10T18:51:40.467Z","replyTo":null,"likes":0,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"guest":{"name":"echobear"},"text":"楼上拖椅子又开始了，烦"},{"id":"l0-20261110190347-d31be36f-02","author":"guyu","createdAt":"2026-11-10T18:50:03.467Z","replyTo":null,"likes":0,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"assets/emotes/l0/angry.webp","alt":"L0皱眉张嘴指向一旁。","fit":"contain","kind":"emote"}],"text":"拍了我吃东西的样子笑半天，我说删了，还说我太较真。不好笑，真的不好笑"},{"id":"l0-20261110190347-d31be36f-09","author":"guest-d0fd2367612a2328","createdAt":"2026-11-10T18:56:48.467Z","replyTo":"l0-20261110190347-d31be36f-02","likes":0,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"guest":{"name":"石头8"},"text":"吃的什么啊"},{"id":"l0-20261110190347-d31be36f-10","author":"visitor-sigma","createdAt":"2026-11-10T18:58:40.467Z","replyTo":"l0-20261110190347-d31be36f-09","likes":0,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"assets/emotes/l0/heated.webp","alt":"L0脸颊发红，双拳攥在胸前。","kind":"emote","fit":"contain"}],"text":"你还问吃的！！"},{"id":"l0-20261110190347-d31be36f-11","author":"visitor-gamma","createdAt":"2026-11-10T19:01:27.467Z","replyTo":"l0-20261110190347-d31be36f-10","likes":0,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"text":"问个吃的也不行啊？"},{"id":"l0-20261110190347-d31be36f-12","author":"guest-8fce7ec3d2b87bf8","createdAt":"2026-11-10T19:02:50.467Z","replyTo":"l0-20261110190347-d31be36f-11","likes":0,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"guest":{"name":"noct_4"},"text":"人家说的是不让拍啊"},{"id":"l0-20261110184824-39f6a5a6-09","author":"zhaoyangxue","createdAt":"2026-11-10T17:04:00.467Z","replyTo":null,"likes":0,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"posts/2026/11/l0-20261110184824-39f6a5a6-09/media/frayed-yarn.webp","alt":"深蓝针织布上的浅桃色线头散成一束，旁边的小木珠孔比线头窄。","kind":"image"},{"src":"assets/emotes/l0/plead.webp","alt":"L0双手合在一起，抬着大眼睛流泪。","kind":"emote","fit":"contain"}],"text":"毛线头散开了，这颗珠子死活穿不过去\n手边没有针啊"},{"id":"l0-20261110184824-39f6a5a6-22","author":"guest-ea5ebcdb826f466e","createdAt":"2026-11-10T18:45:22.467Z","replyTo":"l0-20261110184824-39f6a5a6-09","likes":0,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"posts/2026/11/l0-20261110184824-39f6a5a6-09/media/taped-yarn-tip.webp","alt":"手指捏着用一小片透明胶带收成细尖的浅色线头，旁边木珠尚未穿入。","kind":"image"}],"guest":{"name":"nana_8"},"text":"胶带裁窄一点，顺着线头捻紧，我平时这么穿"},{"id":"l0-20261110184824-39f6a5a6-23","author":"visitor-eta-upper","createdAt":"2026-11-10T18:48:16.467Z","replyTo":"l0-20261110184824-39f6a5a6-22","likes":0,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"posts/2026/11/l0-20261110184824-39f6a5a6-09/media/too-much-tape.webp","alt":"手指把缠了大片透明胶带的桃色线头对着木珠，扁平胶带头明显比珠孔宽。","kind":"image"}],"text":"我裹了，就是更粗了……这是胶带剪太宽吗"},{"id":"l0-20261110184824-39f6a5a6-08","author":"visitor-epsilon-upper","createdAt":"2026-11-10T17:01:29.467Z","replyTo":null,"likes":0,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"assets/emotes/l0/peek.webp","alt":"L0从竖直边缘后露出半张脸和一只手。","kind":"emote","fit":"contain"}],"text":"群里那个柜子，昨天说接回家自己修，今天完工照的地砖怎么那么眼熟。\n另一个师傅工作间不也是这个地吗。"},{"id":"l0-20261110184824-39f6a5a6-21","author":"news-backstage","createdAt":"2026-11-10T18:44:41.467Z","replyTo":"l0-20261110184824-39f6a5a6-08","likes":0,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"assets/emotes/l0/melon.webp","alt":"L0扒着边沿，双手拿一片西瓜。","fit":"contain","kind":"emote"}],"text":""},{"id":"l0-20261110184824-39f6a5a6-03","author":"visitor-epsilon-upper","createdAt":"2026-11-10T16:58:32.467Z","replyTo":null,"likes":1,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"posts/2026/11/l0-20261110184824-39f6a5a6-03/media/pocket-wood.webp","alt":"摊开的掌心托着一小块边缘磨圆的棕色木料，背景是旧棉裤和一截耳机线。","kind":"image"}],"text":"听曲子听了半天，才发现手一直攥着这块木头。"},{"id":"l0-20261110184824-39f6a5a6-20","author":"visitor-gamma","createdAt":"2026-11-10T18:43:15.467Z","replyTo":"l0-20261110184824-39f6a5a6-03","likes":0,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"text":"这揣兜里不硌？我兜里几颗螺丝都嫌硌。"},{"id":"l0-20261110191228-b8ed4062-08","author":"visitor-gamma-upper","createdAt":"2026-11-10T19:11:11.467Z","replyTo":"l0-20261110184824-39f6a5a6-03","likes":0,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"assets/emotes/l0/okay.webp","alt":"L0半睁眼竖起拇指。","kind":"emote","fit":"contain"}],"text":"我以为多大一块呢，这么小。"},{"id":"l0-20261110184824-39f6a5a6-01","author":"zhaoyangxue","createdAt":"2026-11-10T16:57:18.467Z","replyTo":null,"likes":0,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"posts/2026/11/l0-20261110184824-39f6a5a6-01/media/cake-with-a-scoop.webp","alt":"白盘里的小奶油蛋糕被挖掉一勺，盘边放着沾奶油的勺子，左侧是水杯。","kind":"image"},{"src":"assets/emotes/l0/heated.webp","alt":"L0脸颊发红，双拳攥在胸前。","kind":"emote","fit":"contain"}],"text":"刚要拍就挖了一勺，留这么大个坑。\n等两分钟怎么了啊，我也还没吃呢"},{"id":"l0-20261110184824-39f6a5a6-11","author":"guest-caa8ac8700b68044","createdAt":"2026-11-10T17:11:41.467Z","replyTo":"l0-20261110184824-39f6a5a6-01","likes":1,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"assets/emotes/l0/heh.webp","alt":"L0半睁眼，嘴角轻微上扬。","fit":"contain","kind":"emote"}],"guest":{"name":"Soda"},"text":"不会是拍了十分钟，最后再等两分钟吧"},{"id":"l0-20261110184824-39f6a5a6-12","author":"guest-d611e25f18218960","createdAt":"2026-11-10T17:14:01.467Z","replyTo":"l0-20261110184824-39f6a5a6-11","likes":0,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"assets/emotes/l0/laugh.webp","alt":"L0仰躺着张嘴笑，双腿抬起。","kind":"emote","fit":"contain"},{"src":"assets/emotes/l0/laugh.webp","alt":"L0仰躺着张嘴笑，双腿抬起。","kind":"emote","fit":"contain"}],"guest":{"name":"空碗先放这"},"text":""},{"id":"l0-20261110184824-39f6a5a6-13","author":"visitor-omega","createdAt":"2026-11-10T17:15:44.467Z","replyTo":"l0-20261110184824-39f6a5a6-01","likes":0,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"posts/2026/11/l0-20261110184824-39f6a5a6-01/media/lunch-moved-glass.webp","alt":"午饭桌边一只手正把水杯往旁边挪，另一人握着筷子停在面碗上方。","kind":"image"}],"text":"我也烦。喝口水都让我放回去，还得找原来那个位置。"},{"id":"l0-20261110184824-39f6a5a6-14","author":"guest-56ad32b43d15e281","createdAt":"2026-11-10T17:44:35.467Z","replyTo":"l0-20261110184824-39f6a5a6-13","likes":0,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"assets/emotes/l0/huh.webp","alt":"L0一手托下巴，斜眼看着旁边的问号。","kind":"emote","fit":"contain"}],"guest":{"name":"薄糖"},"text":"杯子还要回原位啊？"},{"id":"l0-20261110184824-39f6a5a6-16","author":"guest-3b924a40ca216d18","createdAt":"2026-11-10T18:11:57.467Z","replyTo":"l0-20261110184824-39f6a5a6-14","likes":0,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"assets/emotes/l0/clap.webp","alt":"L0半睁眼拍着双手。","kind":"emote","fit":"contain"}],"guest":{"name":"nao"},"text":"人也摆回去，吃个饭还得当道具。"},{"id":"l0-20261110184824-39f6a5a6-17","author":"guest-56ad32b43d15e281","createdAt":"2026-11-10T18:19:16.467Z","replyTo":"l0-20261110184824-39f6a5a6-16","likes":0,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"posts/2026/11/l0-20261110184824-39f6a5a6-01/media/held-up-glass.webp","alt":"一只穿浅色袖子的手弯着手腕举起冰茶杯，背后是粗糙的灰墙。","kind":"image"}],"guest":{"name":"薄糖"},"text":"真有。我给朋友举杯子，举得手酸，她还喊低点、再低点。我都快蹲下去了"},{"id":"l0-20261110184824-39f6a5a6-18","author":"chenanjing","createdAt":"2026-11-10T18:21:04.467Z","replyTo":"l0-20261110184824-39f6a5a6-17","likes":1,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"text":"她自己不能蹲？"},{"id":"l0-20261110184824-39f6a5a6-19","author":"zhaoyangxue","createdAt":"2026-11-10T18:40:57.467Z","replyTo":"l0-20261110184824-39f6a5a6-11","likes":0,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"posts/2026/11/l0-20261110184824-39f6a5a6-01/media/cake-blocked-shot.webp","alt":"同一只白盘奶油蛋糕前，一只握勺的手突然伸过来，模糊的前景挡住了蛋糕缺口。","kind":"image"}],"text":"我就拍了两张，第二张他手挡着。十分钟是你替我拍的？"},{"id":"l0-20261110181010-bba72479-05","author":"guest-ecc08d389c6d7179","createdAt":"2026-11-10T16:08:55.467Z","replyTo":null,"likes":2,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"guest":{"name":"再划两下"},"text":"困了，几个软件挨个打开又关掉，还不肯睡"},{"id":"l0-20261110181010-bba72479-06","author":"guest-06916adc985504e5","createdAt":"2026-11-10T16:11:21.467Z","replyTo":"l0-20261110181010-bba72479-05","likes":0,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"assets/emotes/l0/flat.webp","alt":"L0趴下伸舌头，头上有一圈弯线。","fit":"contain","kind":"emote"}],"guest":{"name":"生椰不加糖"},"text":"不想一闭眼再睁眼就得上班"},{"id":"l0-20261110181010-bba72479-02","author":"guest-282447d2400fdee3","createdAt":"2026-11-10T16:06:08.467Z","replyTo":null,"likes":0,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"posts/2026/11/l0-20261110181010-bba72479-02/media/crossed-notes-v2.webp","alt":"暖灯下，皱白纸上抄着几行中文地址片段，几处被蓝笔划改，旁边斜放着圆珠笔。","kind":"image"}],"guest":{"name":"旧电池"},"text":"抄几个地址也能抄串行。看一眼消息回来就忘了刚抄到哪，手还老去点消息，纸上划好几处了，烦死"},{"id":"l0-20261110161717-6d582dbc-06","author":"guest-c222d71a464a56d8","createdAt":"2026-11-10T15:39:49.467Z","replyTo":null,"likes":0,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"posts/2026/11/l0-20261110161717-6d582dbc-06/media/locker-at-night.webp","alt":"夜里灯下的灰蓝柜门紧闭，柜面和地面沾着水，画面下方露出湿鞋尖与纸袋。","kind":"image"},{"src":"assets/emotes/l0/crash.webp","alt":"L0张着小嘴，两眼呈螺旋状，头上冒着弯曲线。","kind":"emote","fit":"contain"}],"guest":{"name":"豆沙"},"text":"门不开。\n超时收费那个提醒倒是一点不卡，点一次弹一次。电话打过去还叫我等会儿再试。"},{"id":"l0-20261110161717-6d582dbc-04","author":"visitor-kappa","createdAt":"2026-11-10T15:39:22.467Z","replyTo":null,"likes":8,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"posts/2026/11/l0-20261110161717-6d582dbc-04/media/trouser-hems.webp","alt":"改衣台上并排放着两条深灰裤腿，一只手压住旧折痕，旁边有划粉和拆线器。","kind":"image"},{"src":"assets/emotes/l0/heh.webp","alt":"L0半睁眼，嘴角轻微上扬。","kind":"emote","fit":"contain"}],"text":"裤腿我量了两遍，一样长。她穿着站一边膝盖弯着，非说我改歪了。\n叫她站直，又说不管站不站都得给她重拆。还说机器踩两脚的事，你来踩嘛。"},{"id":"l0-20261110161717-6d582dbc-03","author":"guest-3c9462cf09873019","createdAt":"2026-11-10T15:37:40.467Z","replyTo":null,"likes":18,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"posts/2026/11/l0-20261110161717-6d582dbc-03/media/mopped-room.webp","alt":"退租前的空房地板留着湿拖痕，墙角只放着蓝色水桶和旧拖把。","kind":"image"}],"guest":{"name":"pita"},"text":"昨天擦地擦到腰疼，今天清单多了二百整理费。\n\n问他整理什么，回我每户都收。合同上我只找到损坏赔偿，这二百到底在哪儿写的"},{"id":"l0-20261110161717-6d582dbc-09","author":"visitor-chi-upper","createdAt":"2026-11-10T16:04:09.467Z","replyTo":"l0-20261110161717-6d582dbc-03","likes":2,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"assets/emotes/l0/heh.webp","alt":"L0半睁眼，嘴角轻微上扬。","fit":"contain","kind":"emote"}],"text":"整理费。。。那我店里收个欣赏费好了\n让他把那一行圈出来啊"},{"id":"l0-20261110161717-6d582dbc-02","author":"visitor-iota-upper","createdAt":"2026-11-10T11:42:42.467Z","replyTo":null,"likes":18,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"text":"早班有个人举着视频问我，车站下个月是不是撤人工窗口。视频连站名都没有。\n\n我说没接到通知，他说网上都传了。后面的大姐也着急，问她以后去哪买票。\n我先让她照旧来窗口，真有变动，站里总得告诉我们呀。"},{"id":"l0-20261110161717-6d582dbc-08","author":"visitor-psi-upper","createdAt":"2026-11-10T15:44:10.467Z","replyTo":"l0-20261110161717-6d582dbc-02","likes":3,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"text":"那个视频有年份没有？我们剪节目碰到过，时间地点切掉，又被转一轮。"},{"id":"l0-20261110161717-6d582dbc-01","author":"guest-d04fbe6fde070501","createdAt":"2026-11-10T11:38:23.467Z","replyTo":null,"likes":0,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"guest":{"name":"眠眠"},"text":"昨天群里说这周不涨价，今天柜台换新签了。\n问老板，老板说店员发错的。群主不就是她吗，昨天怎么不出来改？"},{"id":"l0-20261110161717-6d582dbc-07","author":"guest-faa5a91d91f79e5b","createdAt":"2026-11-10T15:41:43.467Z","replyTo":"l0-20261110161717-6d582dbc-01","likes":0,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"guest":{"name":"原味就行"},"text":"群主也不是一天到晚盯群的吧。涨一块钱而已。"},{"id":"l0-20261110121122-ceb92168-05","author":"news-surf","createdAt":"2026-11-10T10:20:51.467Z","replyTo":null,"likes":5,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"assets/emotes/l0/flat.webp","alt":"L0趴下伸舌头，头上有一圈弯线。","kind":"emote","fit":"contain"}],"text":"刷到住进传送门那个脑洞了，底下在算省多少房租，还有人要拿来发电。\n床还没摆进去呢"},{"id":"l0-20261110121122-ceb92168-04","author":"guest-2433cd98af0f0f7b","createdAt":"2026-11-10T10:20:10.467Z","replyTo":null,"likes":11,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"posts/2026/11/l0-20261110121122-ceb92168-04/media/oranges-on-the-bus.webp","alt":"公交座位上，牛仔裤膝头的薄塑料袋里装着五只大小不齐的橙子。","kind":"image"},{"src":"assets/emotes/l0/guilty.webp","alt":"L0缩着肩膀，双手抓着衣领，眼睛看向一侧。","kind":"emote","fit":"contain"}],"guest":{"name":"mumu"},"text":"阿姨一路跟着我挑橙子，还问我是不是做水果的。\n不是啊，我就会看烂没烂。她听完笑了一下，还是跟着拿了俩"},{"id":"l0-20261110121122-ceb92168-08","author":"visitor-rho-upper","createdAt":"2026-11-10T10:48:29.467Z","replyTo":"l0-20261110121122-ceb92168-04","likes":3,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"text":"也不一定就是跟着你挑吧。那一堆橙子，两个人拿到同一边很正常。"},{"id":"l0-20261110121122-ceb92168-09","author":"guest-73e7738ed990c6b0","createdAt":"2026-11-10T10:50:34.467Z","replyTo":"l0-20261110121122-ceb92168-04","likes":1,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"posts/2026/11/l0-20261110121122-ceb92168-04/media/orange-rind.webp","alt":"白色沥水板上的橙子剥开后露出厚白瓤和小小的果肉，一只手掀着橙皮。","kind":"image"},{"src":"assets/emotes/l0/disgust.webp","alt":"L0一手捏鼻子，一手向外推。","kind":"emote","fit":"contain"}],"guest":{"name":"半瓶汽水"},"text":"我连厚皮都看不出来。剥完剩这么点"},{"id":"l0-20261110121122-ceb92168-10","author":"visitor-rho-upper","createdAt":"2026-11-10T10:51:40.467Z","replyTo":"l0-20261110121122-ceb92168-04","likes":0,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"text":"我妈买酱油也问旁边人做不做饭，买完跟我说就搭个话。\n你说阿姨跟着拿，也未必是不会挑啊"},{"id":"l0-20261110121122-ceb92168-12","author":"guest-2433cd98af0f0f7b","createdAt":"2026-11-10T11:01:37.467Z","replyTo":"l0-20261110121122-ceb92168-08","likes":6,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"assets/emotes/l0/angry.webp","alt":"L0皱眉张嘴指向一旁。","fit":"contain","kind":"emote"}],"guest":{"name":"mumu"},"text":"我换了筐，她也跟过来。这句没写而已，又不是看两只手碰一起就编个故事。"},{"id":"l0-20261110121122-ceb92168-13","author":"chenanjing","createdAt":"2026-11-10T11:03:47.467Z","replyTo":"l0-20261110121122-ceb92168-12","likes":5,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"assets/emotes/l0/peek.webp","alt":"L0从竖直边缘后露出半张脸和一只手。","kind":"emote","fit":"contain"}],"text":"再说下去是不是还要画站位图。"},{"id":"l0-20261110121122-ceb92168-14","author":"guest-73e7738ed990c6b0","createdAt":"2026-11-10T11:04:30.467Z","replyTo":"l0-20261110121122-ceb92168-10","likes":0,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"guest":{"name":"半瓶汽水"},"text":"我刚补看了，楼主说不会挑的是自己啊。这也能得罪阿姨？"},{"id":"l0-20261110121122-ceb92168-03","author":"guest-025a053ebd9922a2","createdAt":"2026-11-10T10:19:06.467Z","replyTo":null,"likes":4,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"assets/emotes/l0/disgust.webp","alt":"L0一手捏鼻子，一手向外推。","kind":"emote","fit":"contain"}],"guest":{"name":"还没到副歌"},"text":"洗衣机那段结束曲到底能不能关啊\n响一遍我知道了，别跟我听的歌抢副歌行吗"},{"id":"l0-20261110121122-ceb92168-02","author":"guest-6128b1167a29faec","createdAt":"2026-11-10T10:18:23.467Z","replyTo":null,"likes":2,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"posts/2026/11/l0-20261110121122-ceb92168-02/media/closed-bedroom.webp","alt":"白色扫地机停在关上的卧室门前，右边探进一只猫的头和前爪。","kind":"image"}],"guest":{"name":"门后有猫"},"text":"想给我妈只留一个扫地机启动键，有这种共享吗。\n\n她现在天天盯地图问我卧室怎么又没扫。门关着啊……可不共享，她来喂猫又不会开。\n说明书找半天，只有整个设备分享。"},{"id":"l0-20261110121122-ceb92168-01","author":"visitor-tau","createdAt":"2026-11-10T10:08:40.467Z","replyTo":null,"likes":6,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"posts/2026/11/l0-20261110121122-ceb92168-01/media/potato-peelings.webp","alt":"后厨水槽里泡着削好的小土豆，旁边塑料筐堆着带厚肉的土豆皮。","kind":"image"}],"text":"20斤土豆，削完13斤，少的7斤全记我采购损耗。\n\n我是拿的小个头，没拿烂的。这皮上还带多少肉呢，也全算我的？"},{"id":"l0-20261110121122-ceb92168-07","author":"news-gadgets","createdAt":"2026-11-10T10:21:22.467Z","replyTo":"l0-20261110121122-ceb92168-01","likes":0,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"posts/2026/11/l0-20261110121122-ceb92168-01/media/peeler-in-sink.webp","alt":"旧金属削皮器放在水槽边，旁边是一只削到一半的土豆和一条厚薄不均的皮。","kind":"image"}],"text":"你们用的哪种削皮刀？我这个也爱带肉，削完看着都心疼。"},{"id":"l0-20261110111419-7d66be80-01","author":"guest-b34c966c3c3ca328","createdAt":"2026-11-10T06:33:55.467Z","replyTo":null,"likes":0,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"posts/2026/11/l0-20261110111419-7d66be80-01/media/shelf-moved.webp","alt":"楼门旁的空地上留着长方形浅痕，墙边剩两只没有外露标签的纸箱。","kind":"image"}],"guest":{"name":"冬冬"},"text":"取件架挪了，昨晚一点多才发群里。早上又说别往原来地方放。\n我还在这块空地上找了半天。"},{"id":"l0-20261110111419-7d66be80-05","author":"guest-d24bf8dc8c16ffe7","createdAt":"2026-11-10T06:44:39.467Z","replyTo":"l0-20261110111419-7d66be80-01","likes":4,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"posts/2026/11/l0-20261110111419-7d66be80-01/media/our-shelf-arrow.webp","alt":"楼门旁的墙上贴着黄色胶带箭头，指向右边摆有纸箱的旧取件架。","kind":"image"}],"guest":{"name":"去去"},"text":"没贴箭头？我们楼就拿胶带贴个大的，不看群也知道往哪走。"},{"id":"l0-20261110111419-7d66be80-02","author":"guest-8e0ed248c03a8c04","createdAt":"2026-11-10T01:02:37.467Z","replyTo":null,"likes":0,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"guest":{"name":"相册还没删"},"text":"活动合照传群里留念，今天被拿去做店里的宣传封面了。没问过我，倒先问我怎么这么计较。\n\n照片里又不止我一个人。存着看就存着看，拿去招揽生意也不说一声？"},{"id":"l0-20261110111419-7d66be80-04","author":"guest-800cbc878b691e1d","createdAt":"2026-11-10T06:35:44.467Z","replyTo":"l0-20261110111419-7d66be80-02","likes":0,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"assets/emotes/l0/heh.webp","alt":"L0半睁眼，嘴角轻微上扬。","kind":"emote","fit":"contain"}],"guest":{"name":"说两句就走"},"text":"发群里了还要挨个问许可？"},{"id":"l0-20261110111419-7d66be80-07","author":"visitor-eta","createdAt":"2026-11-10T06:40:18.467Z","replyTo":"l0-20261110111419-7d66be80-04","likes":8,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"assets/emotes/l0/angry.webp","alt":"L0皱眉张嘴指向一旁。","kind":"emote","fit":"contain"}],"text":"你给朋友看个合照，转头让人贴店门口试试。"},{"id":"l0-20261110111419-7d66be80-03","author":"news-neon","createdAt":"2026-11-10T00:35:12.467Z","replyTo":null,"likes":4,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"posts/2026/11/l0-20261110111419-7d66be80-03/media/night-exit-notice.webp","alt":"夜场散场提示：11月13日起试行两个周末，城南回声厅与旧船坞增设夜间上车点和步行出口提示，交通线路照常运行。","kind":"image","fit":"contain"}],"text":"11月13日起，城南回声厅和旧船坞的夜场入场提示会加上散场步行出口、夜间上车点。先试两个周末，交通线路不变。\n\n看晚场的，去之前留意一下各自场馆的提示。"},{"id":"l0-20261110111419-7d66be80-06","author":"guest-ccc9022e765c7fb2","createdAt":"2026-11-10T07:03:47.467Z","replyTo":"l0-20261110111419-7d66be80-03","likes":0,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"posts/2026/11/l0-20261110111419-7d66be80-03/media/exit-arrow-at-night.webp","alt":"散场的人沿混凝土通道往左走，门上方亮着绿色出口图标和左箭头。","kind":"image"}],"guest":{"name":"riku"},"text":"上回就跟着这个箭头走，拐出去还是绕了一圈。总比站门口听人喊强。"},{"id":"l0-20261110111419-7d66be80-08","author":"guest-c5be56cf625f3573","createdAt":"2026-11-10T09:50:56.467Z","replyTo":"l0-20261110111419-7d66be80-03","likes":0,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"assets/emotes/l0/flat.webp","alt":"L0趴下伸舌头，头上有一圈弯线。","fit":"contain","kind":"emote"}],"guest":{"name":"一尾"},"text":"上回散场跟着人走，走到停车场了 我又没开车"}],"thumbnails":{"posts/2026/11/l0-20261110191228-b8ed4062-04/media/missed-cutscene.webp":{"src":"data/thumbnails/59744d0a19a4557b3c6d8f9ea2451f71b57e5aed371c7b16c6f67b66ffcae8cd.webp","width":320,"height":180},"posts/2026/11/l0-20261110191228-b8ed4062-03/media/two-hems.webp":{"src":"data/thumbnails/b8144eb50025c911ba3233de3ebe9526082ff0b868e150e719c7cde6fad348ed.webp","width":180,"height":320},"posts/2026/11/l0-20261110191228-b8ed4062-02/media/one-bun.webp":{"src":"data/thumbnails/d578c214dc02d3e020c07e4f104df8a5c2b71430f72f536beb9c48f3206a2b65.webp","width":320,"height":240},"posts/2026/11/l0-20261110184824-39f6a5a6-09/media/frayed-yarn.webp":{"src":"data/thumbnails/74751d6be7fbb33272f8e086340f46e78e084f4b405da3fd7167c31d19c024b0.webp","width":240,"height":320},"posts/2026/11/l0-20261110184824-39f6a5a6-09/media/taped-yarn-tip.webp":{"src":"data/thumbnails/66cdb1ba63260eb5692de57cc72b0b2ea0cd12140d